sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 用户操作
    participant Input as input 事件
    participant Comp as composition 事件
    participant Lock as 锁标志位
    participant Biz as 业务逻辑 (doSearch)

    Note over User,Biz: Chromium / Blink / WebKit — 空格上屏
    User->>+Input: 按空格选词
    Input->>Lock: isComposing=true → ❌ 拦截
    User->>+Comp: compositionend 触发
    Comp->>Lock: 解锁
    Note over Comp,Biz: 浏览器通常不补发 input
    Comp->>+Biz: ✅ 主动补偿触发 doSearch

    Note over User,Biz: Gecko (Firefox) — 典型时序
    User->>+Comp: 选词上屏
    Comp->>Lock: 解锁
    Comp->>+Biz: ✅ 主动补偿触发 doSearch
    Input->>Biz: 额外 input 触发 → 去重处理
